energetic, but don't get too mischievous, okay?"},"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00071_1/uni00071_1_hom_2.ogg"},{"type":"hom","label":"Home","variant":"base","index":3,"text":{"ja":"私が誰か、ですって？　私はここのマダムで、情報屋。ただそれだけよ","en":"Who am I, you ask? I'm the madam here, an information broker. That's all."},"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00071_1/uni00071_1_hom_3.ogg"},{"type":"hom","label":"Home","variant":"base","index":4,"text":{"ja":"私に興味を持ってくれるのは結構だけれど、あまり首を突っ込みすぎるのは感心しないわね","en":"I'm flattered you're interested in me, but poking your nose too far isn't impressive."},"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00071_1/uni00071_1_hom_4.ogg"},{"type":"hom","label":"Home","variant":"base","index":5,"text":{"ja":"どう？　お近づきの印に、一杯。大丈夫、毒なんて入ってないわ","en":"How about a drink as a token of friendship? Don't worry, there's no poison."},"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00071_1/uni00071_1_hom_5.ogg"},{"type":"hom","label":"Home","variant":"base","index":6,"text":{"ja":"フフ……。ちょっと、坊やの事を見くびっていたかもしれないわね","en":"Heh… I may have underestimated you, kid."},"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00071_1/uni00071_1_hom_6.ogg"},{"type":"hom","label":"Home","variant":"base","index":7,"text":{"ja":"坊やの、その才覚と精力。将来はきっと大物になるわよ……？","en":"Kid, with that talent and vigor, you'll surely become a big shot someday… maybe?"},"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00071_1/uni00071_1_hom_7.ogg"},{"type":"atk","label":"Attack","variant":"base","index":1,"text":null,"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00071_1/uni00071_1_atk_1.ogg"},{"type":"atk","label":"Attack","variant":"base","index":2,"text":null,"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00071_1/uni00071_1_atk_2.ogg"},{"type":"atk","label":"Attack","variant":"base","index":3,"text":null,"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00071_1/uni00071_1_atk_3.ogg"},{"type":"dmg","label":"Damaged","variant":"base","index":1,"text":null,"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00071_1/uni00071_1_dmg_1.ogg"},{"type":"dmg","label":"Damaged","variant":"base","index":2,"text":null,"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00071_1/uni00071_1_dmg_2.ogg"},{"type":"dmg","label":"Damaged","variant":"base","index":3,"text":null,"clip":"Audio/V